        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "38b7b468-7bdb-5c91-a79d-95d6edd7da15",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1456,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.190:block:2",
          "start": 966
        },
        "quote": "(b) Nonemergency Situations. Except in an emergency, any person who, without first having obtained the necessary permit, obstructs or excavates a right-of-way shall subsequently obtain a permit, pay double the normal fee for said permit, pay double all the other fees required by the City code, deposit with the Director the fees necessary to correct any damage to the right-of-way and comply with all of the requirements of this chapter. (Ord. 17587 § 5-16, 10-24-00. Code 1995 § 130-690.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.190:block:2#text",
